<title>USA: M.D.C. Holdings to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>M.D.C. Holdings to buy back up to 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.D.C. Holdings Inc said Monday it approved the repurchase of up to one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>This is in addition to the one million shares approved for repurchase in July, about 947,000 shares of which have been purchased, the company said.</p>
<p>Earlier in 1996, the company completed the repurchase of 1.1 million shares under a program authorized in May 1995.</p>
<p>The company said it will make purchases from time to time, if price levels warrant, in the open market and will consider purchasing shares of the company's common stock in negotiated transactions.</p>
</text>
